to him till the end.

69
00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.670
Ironic, hearing that
from you of all people.

70
00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.840
But you and I are
destined to fight.

71
00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.130
I don't need vengeance
as an excuse.

72
00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:53.420
Wouldn't you agree, Raizo?

73
00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.640
Indeed!

74
00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:34.960
It's done.

75
00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:35.150
My turn! Now, Room!

76
00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.380
My turn. Now, Room!

77
00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.880
Shambles!

78
00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:42.760
Huh? Where am I? It's dark!

79
00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.340
Damn it, Zeus!

80
00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.540
Can you do it, Roronoa?

81
00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.310
