Crossing the Six Paths!

84
00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.010
No, no, no!
Stop the violence!

85
00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.100
I'm just an innocent sword!

86
00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.940
– Mama! Help me, please!
– Mama! Help me, please!

87
00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.190
I'm coming!

88
00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.690
Pathetic!

89
00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:16.750
You thought you could win if you
took my homies away, huh?

90
00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:20.010
You thought you could win if
you took my homies away, huh?

91
00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.130
I'll crush you!

92
00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.720
Don't push it, hag!

93
00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.620
Repel!

94
00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.080
And Takt!

95
00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.260
You idiot!

96
00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.030
You think you'll beat me
by hitting me with a rock?

97
00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.230
Huh? Uh-oh!

98
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.500
Mama!

99
00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:58.690
If there's no one to catch her,
then that's one down!

100
00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.900
If there's no one to catch
her, then that's one down!

101
00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.410
How was that?

102
00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.620
