201
00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:07.980
The last time,
it was too shallow.

202
00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:08.630
In the midst of danger
is when true power blooms!

203
00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:11.670
The midst of danger is
when true power blooms

204
